{"id":"l22wautym8pkz8ie2tg926v26","title":"新发现的亚洲飞蛙物种在印度尼西亚被识别","originalTitle":"New Asian flying frog species identified in Indonesia","summary":"科学家在印度尼西亚的茂密雨林中发现了一种新的亚洲飞蛙物种 Rhacophorus kurniatiae，该物种具有独特的物理特征、叫声和繁殖行为。研究团队在 Mekongga 山脉进行了为期多年的研究，发现这些飞蛙在海拔超过 1,860 米的山区湖泊附近繁殖。该物种的发现发表在期刊 Zootaxa 上。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Phys.org"},"links":{"original":"https://phys.org/news/2026-11-asian-flying-frog-species-indonesia.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T22:20:06.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-17T22:46:34.455Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-17T22:46:34.455Z","category":"life-science","tags":["论文发表","研究成果"],"score":50,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"bf724a9c-2ecf-4108-8d1d-fec076d03d47","title":"印尼发现新亚洲飞蛙物种发表争议"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"bf724a9c-2ecf-4108-8d1d-fec076d03d47","title":"印尼发现新亚洲飞蛙物种发表争议"}],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fNU7uTmDGHLU","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}